## The One Question That Changes Everything

When I work with someone who keeps failing, I asked one this:

 question:**"If you could only do this habit for 2 minutes, would you still want to build it?"**

If the answer is yes, the habit is right but the version is wrong. Shrink the version.
If the answer is no, the habit is wrong. Find a different one.

This question has saved more failed habit attempts than than tip in any book.

